v 0.0.8
d TestMechs (MVP): Stata translation of Jon Roth & Soonwoo Kwon's TestMechs R package.
d
d Installation:
d   net install testmechs, from("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chengchen2326/stata-testmechs/main") replace
d
d testmechs_test_sharpnull (Cox-Shi sharp null test) now ships three bundled Stata
d plugins for its numerical work: dqrdc2 for rank computation, GLPK for LP, and
d OSQP for QP. No Python installation is required.
d
d Precompiled plugins ship for macOS Apple Silicon, macOS Intel, Linux x86_64,
d and Windows x86_64.
d
f src/testmechs_lb_fracaffected.ado
f src/testmechs_lb_fracaffected.sthlp
f src/testmechs_test_sharpnull.ado
f src/testmechs_test_sharpnull.sthlp
f data/mother_data.dta
